.SUBCKT sky130_fd_sc_hd__tapvpwrvgnd_1 VGND VPWR
*.PININFO VGND:I VPWR:I
* Notes: substrate is tied to vgnd and well is tied to vpwr in the
*        cell and do not appear as pins.
.ENDS sky130_fd_sc_hd__tapvpwrvgnd_1


